{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Tis The Season sounds like a holiday album, which connects directly with the Christmas titles repeated in my history.",
    "That recognizable connection gives me a reason to try it when I rarely choose something unfamiliar."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Classic Country Gold and the Smokey Robinson collection offer specific listening directions that my recent history gives me little reason to seek out.",
    "Titles such as Partners and A Different Me leave me unsure how they connect to my interests, so I would pass rather than assume they fit."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The choices seem to treat an interest in a few albums as a broad interest in many other music releases.",
    "Compilations and collections seem to be treated as relevant even though the Christmas theme is the clearer connection among my repeated choices."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Several of my interactions cluster around explicitly Christmas-themed albums, making that theme a stronger clue than simply being another album.",
    "My latest choice, The New Old Fashioned, means my interests may extend beyond Christmas music, but its title alone does not explain which other albums I would want."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The holiday suggestion gives me a clear reason to engage, while most other choices stretch beyond what my limited history supports."
}"}
